            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.113</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Fixes</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>3D Paul in every project.</b> 3D Paul builds and animates scenes again, also right after switching projects, and tells you when a project folder is not reachable.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Models</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Sora 2 and Sora 2 Pro removed.</b> OpenAI has shut down the Sora API. Your existing Sora videos stay in your projects.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
